# B-337: Exact-value match on named-field constructor.
# Constructor [Ok value: a] generates [fn [let value] [variant "Result.Ok" [value: value]]].
# Pattern [case [Ok value: 1] ...] matches a variant with tag "Result.Ok" and payload {value: 1}.
# The scrutinee [Ok value: 1] matches the pattern exactly.
[Result: [type [Ok value: a] [Error msg: Str]]]
[result: [match [Ok value: 1]
  [case [Ok value: 1] "hit"]
  _: "miss"]]
=== out
Dict({"result": String("hit")})

=== warn
[TypeError] auto-indexed entries not supported in type expressions
[UndefinedVariable] undefined variable: Ok
